WEBVTT

00:00:04.330 --> 00:00:07.530
I suppose Sett's having the
 time of his life right now.

00:00:10.170 --> 00:00:12.680
What are you sighing for?

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:18.190
<i>I'm not alone? 
I didn't sense anyone.</i>

00:00:18.690 --> 00:00:21.050
<i>But a single human...</i>

00:00:21.050 --> 00:00:22.840
<i>Might be a good way to kill time.</i>

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:28.720
My companion abandoned me, 
and I've just been so bored.

00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:31.880
I was hoping to find a playmate.

00:00:39.610 --> 00:00:41.440
What a coincidence.

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:42.680
So was I.

00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:45.270
<i>Wh-Who is this person?</i>

00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:49.120
That massive cannon shot earlier...

00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:51.460
That came from you, didn't it?

00:00:51.990 --> 00:00:55.370
You must be regenerating 
the power you expended.

00:00:56.330 --> 00:00:58.760
There'd be no fun slaying you 
in this condition.

00:01:01.840 --> 00:01:03.050
<i>So this is...</i>

00:01:03.050 --> 00:01:05.960
<i>This is why they put me and Sett together!</i>

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:08.850
How long will it take you to recover?

00:01:09.430 --> 00:01:11.590
About five more minutes.

00:01:12.620 --> 00:01:15.840
Let's have a little talk
while we wait, then.

00:02:48.080 --> 00:02:53.540
Ogres and Humans

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:53.920
Not bad at all.

00:03:00.910 --> 00:03:04.780
Look at these two 
powerful creatures I get to fight!

00:03:04.780 --> 00:03:08.660
What a pleasant day!

00:03:20.370 --> 00:03:22.890
<i>How can this human...</i>

00:03:23.120 --> 00:03:25.400
<i>She's not like that demihuman.</i>

00:03:25.400 --> 00:03:27.080
<i>She's something else.</i>

00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:34.520
You must be the monster-slayer 
everyone's talking about.

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:39.350
The traveler, going around 
killing ogres and monsters...

00:03:39.980 --> 00:03:41.530
I'm impressed you've heard of me.

00:03:41.930 --> 00:03:43.490
Why engage in such behavior?

00:03:43.920 --> 00:03:45.910
Some absurd idea of justice?

00:03:46.520 --> 00:03:47.850
I could ask you the same.

00:03:47.850 --> 00:03:51.910
Why break into a castle town 
and kill the humans inside?

00:03:53.180 --> 00:03:55.670
Have a close look at that castle.

00:03:56.200 --> 00:04:00.200
They gouged out the earth, 
cut down the trees, dammed the rivers,

00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:03.070
and carried in giant stones from all around.

00:04:03.070 --> 00:04:05.210
All just to build it.

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:10.110
They feel entitled to destroy the natural world 
that other species need to live.

00:04:11.330 --> 00:04:13.470
Humans, with their unchecked proliferation...

00:04:13.960 --> 00:04:16.830
are the enemies of the entire world.

00:04:16.830 --> 00:04:18.980
Love for nature, then?

00:04:19.910 --> 00:04:21.320
You're the absurd one.

00:04:21.660 --> 00:04:23.570
What's absurd about that?!

00:04:24.720 --> 00:04:26.770
That may be your grand cause,

00:04:26.770 --> 00:04:28.330
but deep down,

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:31.580
you really just want revenge 
against those who stole your land.

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:34.580
It's not as if you'd stop coming after humans

00:04:35.360 --> 00:04:38.090
if they suddenly became 
more considerate of nature.

00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:40.640
I'm the same way,

00:04:41.170 --> 00:04:42.590
so I understand.

00:04:44.590 --> 00:04:48.370
Deep down, we just hate each other.

00:04:48.370 --> 00:04:50.560
That's why we have no qualms 
about slaughtering one another.

00:04:51.050 --> 00:04:52.680
We enjoy it.

00:04:53.120 --> 00:04:54.600
That's all.

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:55.800
Am I wrong?

00:04:56.880 --> 00:04:58.630
Our five minutes have passed.

00:05:05.610 --> 00:05:09.620
You are an unspeakably dangerous being.

00:05:10.040 --> 00:05:13.620
I must kill you here and now.

00:05:13.620 --> 00:05:15.480
Kill <i>me?</i>

00:05:19.610 --> 00:05:22.600
Well, feel free to try.

00:05:24.180 --> 00:05:27.010
You're a dangerous creature.

00:05:27.010 --> 00:05:30.760
I'll have to kill you while I can.

00:05:32.510 --> 00:05:38.020
I feel ashamed to use this on a human.

00:05:38.830 --> 00:05:44.490
<i>But whoever she might be, 
for an ogre to fall to a human...</i>

00:05:44.490 --> 00:05:46.530
<i>It's unthinkable!</i>

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:49.780
Cannon, destroy!

00:05:53.250 --> 00:05:54.390
What was that?

00:05:54.390 --> 00:05:55.540
Sett's cannon?

00:05:55.540 --> 00:05:57.540
Better keep your eyes on the fight!

00:06:02.420 --> 00:06:04.390
A total lack of connection...

00:06:04.870 --> 00:06:06.430
Are you using <i>xian dao?</i>

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:10.740
You identified it in one swing?

00:06:11.290 --> 00:06:14.310
You're correct. This is <i>xian dao</i>.

00:06:14.980 --> 00:06:17.480
Every one of these eyes is my full self!

00:06:18.080 --> 00:06:19.490
<i>Xian dao</i>...

00:06:19.490 --> 00:06:22.350
A technique executed 
by refining one's internal alchemy

00:06:22.350 --> 00:06:25.820
to merge one's <i>qi</i> with the natural world.

00:06:26.360 --> 00:06:31.820
I see. It's a suitable technique 
for a self-proclaimed lover of nature.

00:06:32.380 --> 00:06:34.970
A high ogre using <i>xian dao</i>...

00:06:34.970 --> 00:06:36.660
You're a worthy opponent.

00:06:37.590 --> 00:06:40.190
You honor me, monster-slayer.

00:06:40.190 --> 00:06:42.710
But are you certain 
I should be your priority?

00:06:43.400 --> 00:06:44.200
Excuse me?

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:48.220
It should be clear 
what's going on in the castle.

00:06:48.570 --> 00:06:52.220
Shouldn't your interests lie there instead?

00:06:52.640 --> 00:06:54.260
I don't think so.

00:06:54.690 --> 00:06:58.730
My driving force is not to save humans,

00:06:59.190 --> 00:07:01.380
but to slay ogres.

00:07:01.380 --> 00:07:04.230
I can concern myself with them 
<i>after</i> I've murdered you.

00:07:04.660 --> 00:07:06.280
That intense aura of hostility...

00:07:08.570 --> 00:07:09.910
I made the right choice.

00:07:11.370 --> 00:07:15.120
I sent one eyeball off 
to call for reinforcements.

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:17.490
Oh? When did you do that?

00:07:17.780 --> 00:07:19.230
It's just as I said.

00:07:19.230 --> 00:07:21.140
I'm determined to kill you!

00:07:21.140 --> 00:07:24.500
Do you think you can survive 
until reinforcements arrive?

00:07:26.440 --> 00:07:30.630
My <i>xian dao</i> will buy as much time as I need!

00:07:36.960 --> 00:07:40.270
<i>He extinguished my eyeballs 
with a direct strike of </i>qi?

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:42.690
<i>But... But this is...</i>

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:44.040
<i>This power is...</i>

00:07:45.450 --> 00:07:48.890
She drove the great Sett to desperation

00:07:48.890 --> 00:07:51.280
and forced me to fire my cannon.

00:07:51.580 --> 00:07:53.910
I feel utterly disgraced.

00:07:53.910 --> 00:07:56.960
But at least it's finished.

00:07:56.960 --> 00:07:58.550
What a shock.

00:08:02.670 --> 00:08:04.190
What just happened?

00:08:04.190 --> 00:08:05.810
I heard a big boom.

00:08:05.810 --> 00:08:07.170
How are you still alive?!

00:08:08.400 --> 00:08:09.670
What's going on?!

00:08:11.390 --> 00:08:12.670
Sally?

00:08:13.030 --> 00:08:15.680
How? How can this be?!

00:08:15.680 --> 00:08:17.680
How can you be unscathed?!

00:08:17.680 --> 00:08:21.310
We can't have any more of this, now.

00:08:21.830 --> 00:08:22.810
Can we?

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:30.190
I'd say that cannon 
is your only option left.

00:08:31.120 --> 00:08:32.940
Why not fire it off?

00:08:33.410 --> 00:08:36.200
You might just finish me.

00:08:37.810 --> 00:08:39.510
<i>It's an obvious provocation.</i>

00:08:39.940 --> 00:08:42.050
<i>If the shot is dodged, I'll be—</i>

00:08:46.090 --> 00:08:48.310
I promise I won't dodge.

00:08:48.850 --> 00:08:51.110
I can't move like this.

00:08:51.110 --> 00:08:52.970
Well? What's your next move?

00:08:53.360 --> 00:08:55.120
Will you fire the cannon?

00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:57.840
Or will you tuck your tail 
and run like a coward?

00:08:58.430 --> 00:09:00.470
The choice is yours.

00:09:00.710 --> 00:09:02.470
Well? Go on and make it!

00:09:03.240 --> 00:09:05.760
<i>Has this creature gone mad?</i>

00:09:06.800 --> 00:09:10.600
<i>But after mockery like that, regardless...</i>

00:09:11.220 --> 00:09:12.990
<i>I refuse to flee!</i>

00:09:14.890 --> 00:09:15.740
Cannon!

00:09:24.170 --> 00:09:26.030
<i>I thought this might happen.</i>

00:09:26.690 --> 00:09:29.160
<i>But not even a scratch...</i>

00:09:34.430 --> 00:09:36.090
M-My body...

00:09:44.500 --> 00:09:45.800
It's all over.

00:09:46.960 --> 00:09:50.400
Who in the world are you?

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:04.810
I am Kibitsu Mikoto.

00:10:05.510 --> 00:10:08.870
Sworn enemy of all ogres!

00:10:13.120 --> 00:10:15.070
I, Sett...

00:10:15.070 --> 00:10:17.940
I, who bear the name "High Ogre"...

00:10:17.940 --> 00:10:20.430
To think this is how I'd meet my end...

00:10:21.400 --> 00:10:23.490
It's rather amusing.

00:10:34.160 --> 00:10:35.900
Sally! Sally!

00:10:49.940 --> 00:10:51.520
She's still breathing.

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:53.390
Why didn't you kill her?

00:10:54.060 --> 00:10:56.920
Is that her horn?

00:10:57.490 --> 00:11:00.940
Her ogre power comes 
from her horn and eye.

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:03.800
I've destroyed both.

00:11:04.760 --> 00:11:06.930
Now she's effectively human.

00:11:07.770 --> 00:11:09.860
If an ogre is sufficiently human-like,

00:11:09.860 --> 00:11:11.480
and you sever the source of their power...

00:11:12.150 --> 00:11:13.230
What happens then?

00:11:13.720 --> 00:11:17.820
They'll be rejected 
by both human- and ogrekind, I suppose.

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:18.630
Yes.

00:11:19.290 --> 00:11:22.950
That living hell strikes me 
as more potent than death.

00:11:24.250 --> 00:11:25.700
You're lying.

00:11:28.480 --> 00:11:31.790
I think you saw yourself in her.

00:11:34.240 --> 00:11:35.730
And not just that.

00:11:35.730 --> 00:11:38.010
I'm picking up a familiar scent 
from that castle.

00:11:38.010 --> 00:11:39.970
A scent mixed with the smell of blood.

00:11:40.490 --> 00:11:42.520
I believe you sense it, as well.

00:11:45.290 --> 00:11:46.440
I'm leaving.

00:11:47.170 --> 00:11:48.600
You won't go to see her?

00:11:49.380 --> 00:11:50.160
No...

00:11:50.790 --> 00:11:52.560
But it was a surprise

00:11:53.180 --> 00:11:55.480
to find Saltherine here.

00:11:56.460 --> 00:11:59.120
And a kindred spirit...

00:12:02.530 --> 00:12:03.680
I'm hungry.

00:12:04.370 --> 00:12:06.210
But you didn't do anything.

00:12:06.210 --> 00:12:07.940
I can still get hungry.

00:12:08.410 --> 00:12:11.240
Go on and eat grass, then.

00:12:11.680 --> 00:12:13.010
It looks delicious.

00:12:13.010 --> 00:12:14.210
Don't be ridiculous!

00:12:18.860 --> 00:12:20.260
I've found you.

00:12:22.200 --> 00:12:23.700
Yes, I have found you.

00:12:29.950 --> 00:12:33.020
Welcome back, you stupid bitch.

00:12:38.050 --> 00:12:39.210
Frau?

00:12:39.900 --> 00:12:41.280
Sally is awake!

00:12:41.580 --> 00:12:43.610
Yeah. Good morning...

00:12:44.350 --> 00:12:46.310
Huh? Where am I?

00:12:46.310 --> 00:12:47.440
Palace.

00:12:47.440 --> 00:12:49.200
How long have I been out?

00:12:49.890 --> 00:12:51.600
My memory's so fuzzy.

00:12:54.610 --> 00:12:55.430
An ogre?

00:12:55.430 --> 00:12:57.460
What happened to that big ogre?

00:12:58.090 --> 00:13:00.090
I think you slew it.

00:13:00.950 --> 00:13:02.840
Hawthorn! You're here, too?

00:13:03.330 --> 00:13:05.700
You were the only two people there.

00:13:06.680 --> 00:13:09.850
That means I have 
only Frau's words to go on,

00:13:10.290 --> 00:13:11.750
and every time I ask...

00:13:12.770 --> 00:13:14.900
Sally was invincible. Easy win.

00:13:15.400 --> 00:13:16.850
That's what she tells me.

00:13:17.280 --> 00:13:18.290
Invincible?

00:13:18.970 --> 00:13:21.360
That's right! Are you still hurt, Frau?

00:13:22.470 --> 00:13:23.450
Frau slept.

00:13:23.450 --> 00:13:24.490
Frau woke.

00:13:25.620 --> 00:13:27.120
Frau ate carrots.

00:13:27.120 --> 00:13:28.390
Frau all better!

00:13:28.390 --> 00:13:30.240
Those carrots do the trick, huh?

00:13:31.020 --> 00:13:33.490
This was on the ground 
next to the dead ogre.

00:13:33.940 --> 00:13:35.980
It was pretty soaked with blood.

00:13:35.980 --> 00:13:37.600
My sword?

00:13:37.600 --> 00:13:40.360
There was a big slash 
through the corpse, too.

00:13:42.160 --> 00:13:43.390
It was me, then?

00:13:44.240 --> 00:13:46.640
And there's one other issue to resolve.

00:13:47.250 --> 00:13:49.760
What? What kind of issue?

00:13:50.120 --> 00:13:51.220
You okay to walk?

00:13:53.130 --> 00:13:55.440
Yeah! I think so!

00:13:56.970 --> 00:13:58.020
Follow me.

00:14:02.160 --> 00:14:05.040
Hey! It's Frau and Sally!

00:14:05.040 --> 00:14:07.650
Thank you so much for saving our kingdom!

00:14:07.880 --> 00:14:10.030
Could we shake your hands?

00:14:11.470 --> 00:14:13.080
So soft!

00:14:13.080 --> 00:14:14.970
So soft, yes!

00:14:14.970 --> 00:14:15.970
Frau!

00:14:15.970 --> 00:14:19.110
Don't let strangers take advantage 
of your softness, okay?

00:14:20.930 --> 00:14:23.730
I thought everyone hated demihumans.

00:14:24.210 --> 00:14:26.170
No one cares about that right now.

00:14:26.980 --> 00:14:30.460
You two saved the kingdom 
from an unstoppable monster.

00:14:32.310 --> 00:14:35.400
Everyone here is going to be grateful to you.

00:14:36.070 --> 00:14:37.110
I see.

00:14:38.660 --> 00:14:40.160
Well, we're here.

00:14:40.160 --> 00:14:41.440
Go on in.

00:14:43.680 --> 00:14:45.750
Hey! It's a cell!

00:14:45.750 --> 00:14:46.690
Repeat.

00:14:47.120 --> 00:14:51.180
Are... Are you imprisoning me 
because I'm invincible?!

00:14:51.180 --> 00:14:53.070
Where'd you get that idea?

00:14:53.070 --> 00:14:54.270
Of course not.

00:14:54.270 --> 00:14:56.190
There's someone I want you to meet.

00:14:59.110 --> 00:14:59.960
Here.

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:02.670
Who's she?

00:15:02.670 --> 00:15:05.130
I hear she came with that monster.

00:15:05.750 --> 00:15:11.240
And she blew out the castle wall 
with some mysterious power.

00:15:13.210 --> 00:15:14.350
You mean...

00:15:14.350 --> 00:15:16.850
Yeah. She's not human.

00:15:17.440 --> 00:15:18.400
An ogre.

00:15:19.160 --> 00:15:20.290
No way...

00:15:20.700 --> 00:15:24.480
The testimony came from farmers 
working outside the castle walls.

00:15:25.070 --> 00:15:27.180
She looks totally human to me!

00:15:27.610 --> 00:15:29.440
Look. I'm not exactly an expert.

00:15:30.100 --> 00:15:32.860
But I'm told that human-like ogres 
aren't exactly uncommon.

00:15:33.370 --> 00:15:36.040
What will to happen to her 
if she really is?

00:15:37.490 --> 00:15:40.370
She'll be executed, most likely.

00:15:42.450 --> 00:15:44.900
Some say she'll be unspeakably dangerous 
when she wakes up,

00:15:45.670 --> 00:15:48.880
so we should just kill her before then.

00:15:48.880 --> 00:15:51.320
You can't do that! It's cruel!

00:15:51.960 --> 00:15:52.980
I agree.

00:15:54.730 --> 00:15:58.920
That's why I'm exercising my authority 
to stay the execution.

00:15:59.850 --> 00:16:02.490
I want to hear her side of things 
once she wakes up.

00:16:04.580 --> 00:16:05.650
What?!

00:16:05.890 --> 00:16:09.780
This is a lot like when you arrested us.

00:16:09.780 --> 00:16:12.300
I bet being such a nice guy 
gets you into lots of trouble.

00:16:12.300 --> 00:16:15.160
Thanks. I'm well aware.

00:16:15.940 --> 00:16:18.800
So you want us to watch over her?

00:16:19.300 --> 00:16:20.070
Yeah.

00:16:20.530 --> 00:16:23.230
If she really is an ogre, 
regular knights won't stand a chance.

00:16:23.810 --> 00:16:25.470
Can you handle it, Frau?

00:16:25.930 --> 00:16:26.670
Aye!

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:28.320
What about me?

00:16:28.320 --> 00:16:29.720
I'm invincible!

00:16:29.720 --> 00:16:31.170
Go to it, then.

00:16:31.170 --> 00:16:32.680
You're leaving?

00:16:32.680 --> 00:16:34.960
It's still chaos in the castle.

00:16:35.520 --> 00:16:37.570
I've got way too much to do.

00:16:39.980 --> 00:16:42.100
I'm locking the door for now.

00:16:42.710 --> 00:16:45.110
There are a bunch of knights outside.

00:16:45.110 --> 00:16:46.940
If anything goes down, call me back.

00:16:50.090 --> 00:16:50.940
Let's see...

00:16:51.190 --> 00:16:53.400
Staring.

00:16:52.090 --> 00:16:53.950
What's up, Frau?

00:16:54.220 --> 00:16:55.640
Girl is faking.

00:16:55.640 --> 00:16:56.680
Really awake.

00:17:00.330 --> 00:17:03.450
Could you tell us who you are, at least?

00:17:05.550 --> 00:17:07.330
Isn't it obvious?

00:17:07.330 --> 00:17:08.770
I'm an ogre.

00:17:08.770 --> 00:17:11.590
The mortal enemy of humans like you.

00:17:11.810 --> 00:17:13.520
Um...

00:17:13.520 --> 00:17:16.280
You look pretty human to me, actually.

00:17:17.050 --> 00:17:21.980
<i>I thought I could wait them out 
until my power returned, but...</i>

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:23.950
I find this unpleasant!

00:17:23.950 --> 00:17:27.850
I intend to kill you both instantly 
and leave this place at once!

00:17:28.110 --> 00:17:29.960
Even if my ogre power is diminished,

00:17:30.780 --> 00:17:32.610
an ogre's strength far exceeds

00:17:32.610 --> 00:17:34.110
that of a human!

00:17:37.780 --> 00:17:39.430
Huh? Huh?!

00:17:39.840 --> 00:17:41.870
Why... Why is this happening?!

00:17:42.190 --> 00:17:43.600
She's unbelievable.

00:17:43.600 --> 00:17:45.870
Unbelievably <i>cute!</i>

00:17:48.820 --> 00:17:50.630
My eye... and my horn!

00:17:51.220 --> 00:17:52.420
It can't be...

00:17:53.030 --> 00:17:55.520
Both sources of my ogre power...

00:17:55.990 --> 00:17:59.440
Now I'll never recover my strength!

00:18:00.030 --> 00:18:03.850
After all that, why did you let me live?

00:18:04.640 --> 00:18:06.520
Kibitsu... Mikoto...

00:18:08.140 --> 00:18:09.170
Mikoto?

00:18:09.170 --> 00:18:12.120
Was it a feminine young man with black hair?

00:18:12.570 --> 00:18:14.730
Oh, yes...

00:18:14.730 --> 00:18:16.840
You mean that creature was male?

00:18:17.640 --> 00:18:18.960
If Mikoto came after you,

00:18:18.960 --> 00:18:21.680
I can believe you're an ogre.

00:18:22.220 --> 00:18:24.320
Can you tell me what 
happened between you?

00:18:36.200 --> 00:18:37.880
And that's that.

00:18:37.880 --> 00:18:40.110
After I lost,

00:18:40.110 --> 00:18:42.860
he destroyed the sources 
of my ogre power

00:18:42.860 --> 00:18:45.060
and left me here to rot.

00:18:46.840 --> 00:18:49.450
What are you grinning about?

00:18:49.450 --> 00:18:50.990
I find it very unpleasant!

00:18:50.990 --> 00:18:52.620
Sorry, sorry!

00:18:52.620 --> 00:18:55.650
Now that I know Mikoto is close, 
I can't help it!

00:18:56.820 --> 00:18:57.800
Okay!

00:18:57.800 --> 00:18:59.740
We're moving out, Frau!

00:18:59.740 --> 00:19:00.570
Aye!

00:19:01.540 --> 00:19:03.580
Thanks for the information.

00:19:05.700 --> 00:19:08.020
I won't tell them about you.

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:11.330
Don't you go volunteering 
your ogre origins, either.

00:19:11.670 --> 00:19:12.990
Why not?

00:19:12.990 --> 00:19:15.850
If they find out you really are one, 
they'll execute you.

00:19:17.610 --> 00:19:19.340
So don't tell them, okay?

00:19:21.000 --> 00:19:22.250
Execute me?

00:19:24.040 --> 00:19:26.100
Perhaps I'd prefer that.

00:19:28.190 --> 00:19:30.940
Having lost my ogre power, perhaps...

00:19:31.680 --> 00:19:35.410
Perhaps I'd be better off dying as an ogre,

00:19:35.410 --> 00:19:37.610
with my ogre spirit undiminished,

00:19:37.610 --> 00:19:41.110
than to live on like this.

00:19:43.340 --> 00:19:45.560
Frau. Princess's orders!

00:19:45.560 --> 00:19:48.430
This isn't a move-out. It's a jailbreak!

00:19:48.430 --> 00:19:49.680
Get it done!

00:19:49.680 --> 00:19:50.620
Aye.

00:19:55.380 --> 00:19:59.490
Wh-What are you people doing?

00:19:59.490 --> 00:20:00.110
C'mon!

00:20:00.110 --> 00:20:02.580
Quit staring, and follow us!

00:20:04.230 --> 00:20:06.290
You might be an ogre,

00:20:06.290 --> 00:20:09.640
but that doesn't mean 
I can leave you behind

00:20:09.640 --> 00:20:12.770
while you're talking 
about letting them kill you!

00:20:15.410 --> 00:20:17.840
C'mon, hurry! Get up!

00:20:23.380 --> 00:20:26.530
<i>Even without my power, 
I remain an ogre.</i>

00:20:26.790 --> 00:20:30.040
<i>So I'll just use her 
as long as I need her!</i>

00:20:30.690 --> 00:20:32.470
I shall consent to travel with you.

00:20:32.930 --> 00:20:35.310
But that doesn't make us companions!

00:20:35.310 --> 00:20:37.040
Surly girl!

00:20:37.810 --> 00:20:40.630
I think we've got an
 accounting of the damages.

00:20:41.170 --> 00:20:43.390
Your next job will be searching 
for the missing—

00:20:43.390 --> 00:20:45.680
Commander! Commander Hawthorn!

00:20:46.240 --> 00:20:47.190
What's wrong?

00:20:47.190 --> 00:20:50.630
The ogre girl prisoner escaped!

00:20:51.660 --> 00:20:52.530
Damn it!

00:20:52.530 --> 00:20:54.410
I underestimated her.

00:20:54.410 --> 00:20:56.060
Are Sally and Frau okay?

00:20:56.300 --> 00:20:58.870
W-Well... The fact is...

00:20:58.870 --> 00:21:01.070
I believe Sally is leading her out.

00:21:01.750 --> 00:21:02.500
What?

00:21:03.290 --> 00:21:05.170
Sally! Frau!

00:21:05.170 --> 00:21:06.450
Please come back!

00:21:06.450 --> 00:21:07.880
They're so determined!

00:21:07.880 --> 00:21:11.150
Kill a few of them, 
and I'm sure they'll give up!

00:21:11.150 --> 00:21:13.860
What? 
That's a total ogre thing to do!

00:21:13.860 --> 00:21:15.570
I <i>am</i> an ogre!

00:21:15.570 --> 00:21:17.960
That's why we're running, remember?!

00:21:18.260 --> 00:21:19.750
Let's just get out of here!

00:21:21.750 --> 00:21:23.600
Stop this, Sally!

00:21:23.600 --> 00:21:26.010
I sympathize with your position.

00:21:26.010 --> 00:21:28.300
But as a knight, 
I can't let you escape!

00:21:28.300 --> 00:21:28.970
Frau!

00:21:29.280 --> 00:21:29.800
Aye!

00:21:31.530 --> 00:21:32.670
Sorry!

00:21:32.670 --> 00:21:33.650
Sally!

00:21:33.650 --> 00:21:35.480
Do you realize what you're doing?!

00:21:35.480 --> 00:21:36.990
Of course I do!

00:21:36.990 --> 00:21:39.520
That's why I'm running away really fast!

00:21:39.520 --> 00:21:41.150
You're a nice guy, remember?

00:21:41.150 --> 00:21:42.270
Just let us go!

00:21:42.270 --> 00:21:43.990
You think I can do that?!

00:21:44.310 --> 00:21:46.020
Captain! Your horse!

00:21:46.020 --> 00:21:49.210
Thanks. I'll go on ahead.

00:21:49.210 --> 00:21:50.990
Send any free riders after me.

00:21:51.250 --> 00:21:52.990
Yes, sir!

00:21:52.990 --> 00:21:54.000
Take care—

00:21:59.000 --> 00:22:02.000
<i>It happened in an instant.</i>

00:22:08.440 --> 00:22:10.740
<i>The kingdom where we'd been 
just moments prior</i>

00:22:11.360 --> 00:22:14.020
<i>was gone without a trace.</i>

00:23:46.040 --> 00:23:50.250
Sally and a Crossroads

00:23:46.450 --> 00:23:49.020
Next time: "Sally and a Crossroads."
